    "subjectId": "vpp",
    "topic": "Veterinary Pathology",
    "questionText": "The hallmark intestinal pathology of 'Johne’s Disease' (Paratuberculosis / Mycobacterium avium subsp. paratuberculosis) in cattle is:",
